# History Directory

This directory stores timestamped snapshots of extension data for change tracking.

## Contents
- `all_extensions_<timestamp>.json` - Microsoft extension snapshots
- `all_verified_extensions_<timestamp>.json` - Verified publisher snapshots
- `all_unverified_extensions_<timestamp>.json` - Unverified publisher snapshots
- `verified_publishers_<timestamp>.json` - Verified publisher summary snapshots
- `unverified_publishers_<timestamp>.json` - Unverified publisher summary snapshots

## Usage
The `flows/diff.py` module compares the two most recent snapshots to generate a `diff_report.json`.
